    },
    "Every resting hamzah a long vowel, يُومِنُونَ, and the name إِسۡرَآيلَ without its hamzah." : {},
    "Every resting hamzah becomes a long vowel: يُؤۡمِنُونَ is read يُومِنُونَ and بِئۡسَ as بِيسَ. The mushaf writes it so, which is why it carries about 1,500 fewer hamzah signs than Hafs's." : {},
    "Every resting hamzah turned into a long vowel, يُومِنُونَ, تُومَرُونَ, on top of Abu Amr's dropped first hamzah, هَٰؤُلَا إِن." : {},
    "Every riwayah's printed color code, side by side." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "رموز الألوان المطبوعة لكل رواية، جنبًا إلى جنب."
