    },
    "Softening the hamzah into a plain vowel so the word runs smoothly." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تليين الهمزة حتّى تصير حركةً مجرّدة لتنساب الكلمة."
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ہمزہ کو نرم کر کے محض ایک حرکت بنا دینا تاکہ کلمہ روانی سے نکل جائے۔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Softens only the final hamzah of a word at a stop, and may slip an alef between two hamzahs in one word, ءَٰا۬نتَ." : {},
    "Softens the second of two hamzahs meeting between words where al-Bazzi drops the first." : {},
    "Softens the second of two hamzahs meeting between words, ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ اَلَآ, and reads الصراط with a seen, صِۜرَٰطَ." : {},
    "Softness" : {
